01 cleo   cut   0.00-  4.50  speech   0.00-  4.00 | Claude, checkout's celebrating. Every order failed.
02 claude cut   4.50-  5.68  speech   4.60-  5.30 | Why confetti?
03 cleo   cut   5.68-  9.78  speech   5.86-  9.44 | That's the success screen. Every failed order gets a party.
04 claude cut   9.78- 11.52  speech   9.96- 11.24 | Didn't you add error handling?
