06 claude cut  17.04- 21.67  speech  17.26- 21.26 | Because that five hundred is a response, not a rejected promise.
07 cleo   cut  21.67- 23.68  speech  21.70- 23.54 | So the catch should catch it!
08 claude cut  23.68- 27.34  speech  24.04- 27.34 | Fetch doesn't reject just because the HTTP status says failure.
09 cleo   cut  27.34- 32.50  speech  27.34- 32.14 | So my app heard "no"... and threw a party?
10 claude cut  32.50- 37.83  speech  32.94- 37.52 | Await fetch, check response dot ok. If false, throw an error.
11 cleo   cut  37.83- 44.58  speech  38.08- 44.30 | If not response dot ok... throw... It's red! It actually failed!
